Description: Nodes for time series in a trama graph: operators (differencing,
    lags, transforms, windows, moving averages, aggregation), classical and
    STL decomposition, ARIMA, ETS and Holt-Winters models with forecasts and
    benchmarks, stationarity and white-noise tests, and series-specific plots
    such as correlograms, seasonal and lag plots. Builds on trama.data for
    tables and on trama.view for plots, without duplicating either.
